  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may stun foes with a weapon blow at will.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Stunning Critical<sup>CRB</sup>, 3rd mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per round when you hit a foe with an attack, but the attack is not a critical, you may expend two uses of mythic power to inflict the effect of the Stunning Critical feat rather than your attack’s normal damage.</p>\n<p>You may not add the effects of more than one mythic critical feat to a single attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc103\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
